{"1987730": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Smiths & Legends", "steam_appid": 1987730, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Run your own blacksmithing shop with your friends in this top-down multiplayer RPG!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gather resources and craft items to sell or use to defend your shop from enemies.   </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >How much money can you make before your shop is destroyed?!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1987730/extras/d6944fedfc52f10b6d57e21a5aa99232.poster.avif?t=1768261364\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1987730/extras/d6944fedfc52f10b6d57e21a5aa99232.webm?t=1768261364\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1987730/extras/d6944fedfc52f10b6d57e21a5aa99232.mp4?t=1768261364\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FEATURES</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Online/Local Co-op</strong> - Play solo or with up to 4 friends in online and split-screen multiplayer.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Blacksmithing</strong> - Gather resources to craft weapons, and other goods to sell to customers.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Combat -</strong> Use the items you've crafted to defend your shop from monsters and bosses!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>RPG Mechanics </strong>- Carefully manage your Blacksmith’s HP, stamina and weapon durability...</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Party Progression</strong> - Based on your earnings, level up and unlock permanent perks!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fully voiced storyline - </strong>Will you uncover the secrets of <i>The Legendary Omnismith</i>?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1987730/extras/83e206e4010e8f8d58b19d8310702d97.poster.avif?t=1768261364\" width=125 height=183 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1987730/extras/83e206e4010e8f8d58b19d8310702d97.webm?t=1768261364\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1987730/extras/290666b685d0788be38f26775d3e6f62.poster.avif?t=1768261364\" width=237 height=275 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1987730/extras/290666b685d0788be38f26775d3e6f62.webm?t=1768261364\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >BLACKSMITHING (AND LEGEND-ING)</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Harvest resources and craft whatever your customers desire... <br>But you'll need to protect your shop at the same time!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1987730/extras/7218371351ffc79014b543ba1c704807.poster.avif?t=1768261364\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1987730/extras/7218371351ffc79014b543ba1c704807.webm?t=1768261364\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1987730/extras/7218371351ffc79014b543ba1c704807.mp4?t=1768261364\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=