h\" >Did he succeed in his endeavour?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Or was the <strong>Omnismith's</strong> efforts lost in vain forever?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Let's be real - if everything went well...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Would there be much of a story to tell?!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1987730/extras/b624c36350cc0f31e82591688078500b.poster.avif?t=1768261364\" width=139 height=189 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1987730/extras/b624c36350cc0f31e82591688078500b.webm?t=1768261364\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >SO WHAT'RE YOU WAITING FOR?</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1987730/extras/18316a78f4b4f9b2ec7dcb9f7e405220.poster.avif?t=1768261364\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1987730/extras/18316a78f4b4f9b2ec7dcb9f7e405220.webm?t=1768261364\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1987730/extras/18316a78f4b4f9b2ec7dcb9f7e405220.mp4?t=1768261364\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What do you mean it's too hot?! You're a blacksmith!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1987730/extras/9e6d0c501c8386f99c5f4374da8f0dab.poster.avif?t=1768261364\" width=640 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1987730